{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a scavenger-hunt adventure that spans <strong>84 hand-crafted levels</strong>, while getting to know the four friends who struggle to keep their video game studio together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find much more than just cats on this journey...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.poster.avif?t=1772589132\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.webm?t=1772589132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.mp4?t=1772589132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Matt's Cats features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of items to find, and <strong>20+ hours of gameplay</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulty modes</strong>, with different goals in each, allowing for multiple play-throughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot-the-difference challenges, and other <strong>secret game modes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>meta narrative</strong> about game development and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasional dark humour. (disabled by default for a family-friendly experience)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of accessibility options. (play at your own pace)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% DRM-free</strong>, so you can make a copy for your grandma!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap